  m_WindowTitle:
    m_Untranslated: Game Design Mini Project
  m_Title:
    m_Untranslated: "Mini Project : Design Your First Level \U0001F3AE!"
  m_Description:
    m_Untranslated: "In this activity, you will become a Level Designer !\n\nYour task is to create your own simple game level using the assets and tile set provided.\n\nYou don't need to write code or create a player character. Just focus on designing your level !\n\nYour Mission \U0001F3AF\nCreate a level with a clear path from the starting point to the ending point.\n\nLet's Get Started \U0001F6E0\uFE0F!\n\nStep 1 : Explore the Assets\nTake a look at the assets and tiles provided. Familiarize yourself with the available elements.\n\nStep 2 : Build Your Level\nUse the tiles to create the ground, platforms, and environment.\n\nStep 3 : Set the Starting Point\nChoose and mark where the level begins.\n\nStep 4 : Set the Ending Point\nChoose and mark where the level ends.\n\nStep 5 : Review Your Design\nMake sure your level has a clear path from start to finish.\n\nStep 6 : Save Your Level\nSave your design and get it ready to share!\n\nYour Level Must Include \u2705 :\nA starting position ( START )\nAn ending position ( END )\nGround and platforms\nA clear path connecting both points\n\nChallenge \u2B50\uFE0F!\nCan you make your level creative, interesting, and easy to understand ?\n\nYou're Done \U0001F389! \nCongratulations! You've designed your first game level .\n\nNote: if you got stuck, contact the mentors in Discord or WhatsApp "
  m_MaskEditor: 0
  m_Buttons:
  - Text:
      m_Untranslated: Let's Begin !
    Tooltip:
      m_Untranslated: 
